These files were first generated from Dawn on 2023-10-23. Skia internally relies
on Dawn extended webgpu headers for native operation. The public Skia interface
only relies on the webgpu headers. Thus, when Skia is compiling itself
(i.e. when SKIA_IMPLEMTATION is true) these extended headers are used and when
compiling a client file that includes a Skia header the public webgpu header is used.
This behavior is controlled in include/private/dawn/SkiaWebGpuCpp.h.

The generated Dawn webgpu headers were modified to remove the error message that is issued
when compiling with Emscripten. webgpu_cpp.h was modified to include the other two headers by their
full path from the skia root.